WEBVTT

00:01.880 --> 00:03.770
<i>It's the second match of the semi-finals.</i>

00:03.770 --> 00:07.060
<i>Nankatsu SC are up against Musashi FC,</i>

00:07.060 --> 00:08.940
<i>led by Jun Misugi.</i>

00:08.940 --> 00:12.360
<i>At the start, both teams were evenly matched.</i>

00:12.360 --> 00:15.280
<i>However, demonstrating his tactical superiority,</i>

00:15.830 --> 00:21.290
<i>Misugi used his secret plan, the offside trap, to shut Tsubasa down.</i>

00:21.290 --> 00:23.580
<i>Offside!</i>

00:25.580 --> 00:27.080
<i>Offside again!</i>

00:27.080 --> 00:33.550
<i>With this, Nankatsu's attack was sealed, putting them in a dilemma.</i>

00:33.550 --> 00:37.180
<i>He has more technical skill than me.</i>

00:37.180 --> 00:38.730
<i>He does the job of directing his team</i>

00:38.730 --> 00:42.140
<i>as a captain better than I can,</i>

00:42.140 --> 00:47.100
<i>with the added handicap of a heart disease.</i>

00:48.260 --> 00:50.440
<i>There's no way I can win.</i>

00:51.650 --> 00:53.900
<i>I won't be able to match Misugi.</i>

00:53.900 --> 00:55.570
<i>What's with you, Tsubasa?</i>

00:55.570 --> 00:58.490
<i>Have you lost the will to fight?</i>

00:58.490 --> 01:00.070
<i>I'm no match for him.</i>

01:00.070 --> 01:03.080
<i>I beg of you, Tsubasa, come towards me.</i>

01:03.080 --> 01:05.200
<i>Stop me!</i>

01:05.200 --> 01:06.660
<i>No match at all.</i>

01:10.820 --> 01:12.130
<i>It's over.</i>

01:14.800 --> 01:18.550
<i>Sanada scores the goal! It's 3-1!</i>

01:18.550 --> 01:21.140
<i>A 2 goal lead at last!</i>

01:21.140 --> 01:24.940
Everyone, this is our match now.

01:24.940 --> 01:28.020
Don't hold back. Crush Nankatsu!

01:28.020 --> 01:29.810
Yeah!

01:47.040 --> 01:52.690
<i>The smell of the grass when I stumbled,</i>

01:47.040 --> 01:52.690
<i>koronda toki no shibafu no nioi</i>

01:52.690 --> 01:57.700
<i>the endless blue of the sky above...</i>

01:52.690 --> 01:57.700
<i>aogimita sora no ao hateshinakatta</i>

01:58.370 --> 02:03.540
<i>This winding, back-and-forth path</i>

01:58.370 --> 02:03.580
<i>mayotte modori susumu kidô ga</i>

02:04.250 --> 02:11.870
<i>is a map for our endless dreams</i>

02:04.250 --> 02:11.870
<i>hateshinai yume o miru boku-tachi no chizu</i>

02:11.870 --> 02:17.610
<i>Even if my hopes miss the goal</i>

02:11.870 --> 02:17.610
<i>goal o soreta kibô ga atte mo</i>

02:17.610 --> 02:26.140
<i>if I stand back up, my dreams will never end</i>

02:17.610 --> 02:26.140
<i>mata tachiagaru nara yume wa owaranai</i>

02:26.140 --> 02:31.930
<i>No.1! Race forth, faster than anyone</i>

02:26.140 --> 02:31.930
<i>No. 1! dare yori hayaku kakenuke</i>

02:31.930 --> 02:37.860
<i>Make a starting dash toward the world stage with your tricky plays!</i>

02:31.930 --> 02:37.860
<i>tricky na play de sekai e muke Start! Dash!</i>

02:37.860 --> 02:39.370
<i>Run & Run!</i>

02:39.370 --> 02:46.660
<i>Aspirations are the one buzz, buzz, buzz that gets us moving</i>

02:39.370 --> 02:46.660
<i>akogare dake ga boku-ra o chiri-chiri-chiri ugokasu yo
</i>

02:46.660 --> 02:49.580
<i>Blaze, blaze, blaze! Let's go, it's kickoff!</i>

02:46.660 --> 02:49.580
<i>mera-mera-mera iku ze kickoff</i>

02:49.580 --> 02:54.510
<i>Leap out into a giant field of dreams</i>

02:49.580 --> 02:54.510
<i>tobidasô dodekai dream field</i>

03:05.330 --> 03:10.080
<b><b>EPISODE 21:
THE ACE OF GLASS</b></b>

03:10.290 --> 03:11.580
On your feet, Tsubasa!

03:12.360 --> 03:15.000
You have to stand up, Tsubasa!

03:16.670 --> 03:17.920
Wakabayashi!

03:18.620 --> 03:19.920
Wakabayashi.

03:19.920 --> 03:23.240
Were you planning to let it end it like this?

03:23.240 --> 03:26.350
You would waste everyone's effort in this way?

03:26.350 --> 03:31.480
Was Nankatsu's football— no, was your football such a weak thing?

03:31.480 --> 03:33.760
Answer me! Tsubasa!

03:33.760 --> 03:36.150
Wakabayashi.

03:36.150 --> 03:39.650
I came all this way so I could play in the final tomorrow.

03:39.650 --> 03:43.650
So, answer me, Tsubasa! Is this the end for you?!

03:44.900 --> 03:47.320
Wakabayashi is right!

03:47.320 --> 03:49.620
Are you going to let it end like this?!

03:49.620 --> 03:53.460
Weren't you going to Brazil with me, Tsubasa!?

03:54.140 --> 03:55.120
Roberto...

03:55.520 --> 03:56.580
That's right!

03:56.580 --> 03:59.500
Losing just doesn't suit you!

03:59.500 --> 04:01.300
Do your best, Tsubasa!

04:01.300 --> 04:02.920
I am rooting for you.

04:02.920 --> 04:04.810
So just win!

04:07.200 --> 04:10.930
Tsubasa, you aren't the type of guy who'd let it end like this.

04:11.520 --> 04:14.640
You are the first person I acknowledged as a rival.

04:15.350 --> 04:17.690
I can't believe someone could be stronger than you.

04:17.690 --> 04:21.020
Even if you do, I will not.

04:21.610 --> 04:23.070
So get on your feet, Tsubasa!

04:23.070 --> 04:27.950
We will beat Kojiro Hyuga's Meiwa this time!

04:28.950 --> 04:31.330
I owe him some payback.

04:31.330 --> 04:34.960
Tsubasa, you owe him for the preliminaries, too.

04:35.700 --> 04:39.840
Despite all this, will you not fight, Tsubasa?!

04:39.840 --> 04:41.840
He's right, Tsubasa.

04:41.840 --> 04:46.990
I am sure Misugi doesn't think this is really you.

04:46.990 --> 04:47.680
Huh...?

04:48.370 --> 04:50.300
You can't let it end this way.

04:50.300 --> 04:54.440
If you did, you'd be betraying your teammates, everyone who has cheered for you,

04:54.440 --> 05:00.020
all the rivals you've fought against, and even the football, your friend.

05:16.080 --> 05:17.160
Tsubasa.

05:17.160 --> 05:18.420
Tsubasa!

05:19.960 --> 05:21.040
Tsubasa!

05:24.860 --> 05:26.550
I'm sorry, guys.

05:26.550 --> 05:29.300
Wavering like this, even though I'm your captain...

05:29.300 --> 05:30.830
You're right.

05:30.830 --> 05:33.480
We can't let it end like this.

05:33.480 --> 05:36.930
I was about to ruin all of your hard work.

05:36.930 --> 05:38.440
I'll do it.

05:40.070 --> 05:43.400
I will get those 2 goals back, no matter what!

05:43.400 --> 05:44.480
All right!

05:44.480 --> 05:47.200
Now that Tsubasa's recovered, it'll be a piece of cake.

05:47.200 --> 05:49.570
You're right! The real game starts now!

05:49.570 --> 05:51.410
Let's show them what Nankatsu's made of!

05:52.040 --> 05:53.330
<i>Just watch, Wakabayashi.</i>

05:53.330 --> 05:55.370
<i>I will do it.</i>

05:55.370 --> 05:56.870
<i>Tsubasa...</i>

05:59.450 --> 06:02.670
<i>I guess you're not done yet, Tsubasa.</i>

06:02.670 --> 06:06.220
<i>Nankatsu SC seems to have recovered!</i>

06:06.220 --> 06:09.680
<i>They look to switch back to attack, but the score difference remains 2!</i>

06:09.680 --> 06:13.680
<i>Will they be able to score 2 goals in the remaining ten minutes?</i>

06:13.680 --> 06:15.360
Do your best, Tsubasa!

06:15.360 --> 06:16.930
I am counting on you guys!

06:18.430 --> 06:20.940
<i>The match resumes with Nankatsu's kick-off!</i>

06:20.940 --> 06:22.330
Here I come, Musashi!

06:22.330 --> 06:24.690
All right! Let's follow Tsubasa!

06:24.690 --> 06:25.610
I won't let you!

06:26.380 --> 06:29.650
<i>Tsubasa's showing his smooth dribbling once more.</i>

06:29.650 --> 06:30.740
Tsubasa...

06:35.580 --> 06:37.330
That's the way, Tsubasa!

06:37.330 --> 06:39.020
<i>That's it, Tsubasa.</i>

06:39.020 --> 06:44.000
<i>Against Misugi, you were lacking in heart, not technique.</i>

06:44.000 --> 06:46.050
<i>Don't forget that spirit,</i>

06:46.050 --> 06:51.630
<i>and keep moving towards becoming a genius football player, Tsubasa.</i>

06:52.840 --> 06:55.680
<i>Tsubasa dodges with a jump!</i>

06:55.680 --> 07:01.640
<i>Despite the rain, he's not dragging his feet, and he hasn't been slowed at all.</i>

07:01.640 --> 07:04.690
<i>This is how the true Tsubasa looks like!</i>

07:07.010 --> 07:07.820
Misaki!

07:10.530 --> 07:11.740
What?!

07:11.740 --> 07:13.990
I am returning this to you, Tsubasa!

07:15.980 --> 07:17.370
<i>The passes connect!</i>

07:17.370 --> 07:19.370
<i>Beautiful combinations between the two!</i>

07:19.870 --> 07:22.060
<i>Nankatsu's Golden Duo has been revived!</i>

07:22.060 --> 07:24.000
That's it Tsubasa, Misaki!

07:24.000 --> 07:27.520
<i>But the goalkeeper Tazawa and Misugi are standing in their way.</i>

07:27.520 --> 07:29.760
<i>Misugi may have better technique now,</i>

07:29.760 --> 07:33.260
<i>but my spirit will win this battle in the end!</i>

07:33.260 --> 07:34.880
<i>Come at me, Tsubasa!</i>

07:34.880 --> 07:37.010
<i>I, Jun Misugi, shall not let you pass.</i>

07:37.010 --> 07:38.510
<i>It's on!</i>

07:44.920 --> 07:46.560
<i>Wow, he stopped him!</i>

07:49.190 --> 07:50.190
Tsubasa!

07:50.190 --> 07:51.320
<i>I won!</i>

07:51.320 --> 07:52.570
It's not over yet!

07:53.360 --> 07:54.280
What?

07:54.280 --> 07:55.840
<i>It's a brilliant move!</i>

07:55.840 --> 07:58.830
<i>Tsubasa flicks the ball up with his heel as he falls!</i>

07:58.830 --> 08:01.080
<i>Still, Kido races in to recover the loose ball!</i>

08:01.080 --> 08:02.390
Jump, Tsubasa!

08:02.390 --> 08:03.460
Use your guts!

08:03.460 --> 08:05.750
<i>Wakabayashi.</i>

08:08.880 --> 08:13.010
<i>Despite the difficult position, Tsubasa jumps!</i>

08:14.730 --> 08:16.640
<i>The keeper can't reach it!</i>

08:16.640 --> 08:17.640
He did it!

08:19.600 --> 08:22.020
<i>Oh no, the ball hits the crossbar!</i>

08:23.060 --> 08:26.020
<i>Nankatsu's revived ace couldn't score!</i>

08:26.020 --> 08:28.940
Even after all of Tsubasa's effort, was it not enough?

08:28.940 --> 08:30.690
It's not over yet!

08:31.440 --> 08:34.120
Let's show them Nankatsu's synchronized offense!

08:34.120 --> 08:34.890
Right!

08:34.890 --> 08:35.700
Guys!

08:35.700 --> 08:38.450
<i>Nankatsu's fighting spirit hasn't given up!</i>

08:40.890 --> 08:42.500
<i>Urabe steals the ball!</i>

08:42.500 --> 08:44.710
All right! Let's go, Tsubasa!

08:44.710 --> 08:46.400
They will go for a long pass.

08:46.400 --> 08:47.040
Go!

08:47.040 --> 08:48.480
Execute the offside trap!

08:48.480 --> 08:49.400
Okay!

08:52.840 --> 08:53.870
<i>That's it.</i>

08:53.870 --> 08:56.180
<i>I will keep up with the offside line!</i>

08:59.300 --> 09:00.760
Don't pass it, yet!

09:01.400 --> 09:02.110
What?!

09:02.110 --> 09:05.940
<i>Oh my, Misaki has blocked Urabe's pass!</i>

09:12.270 --> 09:14.100
Now's the time!

09:14.100 --> 09:16.100
<i>Misaki sends a pass to Tsubasa!</i>

09:16.100 --> 09:16.740
Crap!

09:16.740 --> 09:18.570
Make it count this time, Tsubasa!

09:18.570 --> 09:20.830
<i>He still has a player and the goalkeeper to beat!</i>

09:20.830 --> 09:23.080
<i>It is not offside!</i>

09:28.580 --> 09:29.960
<i>It's in!</i>

09:29.960 --> 09:34.000
<i>Tsubasa breaks the trap and scores with a jumping volley!</i>

09:34.000 --> 09:35.630
I did it!

09:35.630 --> 09:37.630
Tsubasa, nice shot!

09:37.630 --> 09:39.510
You did it, Tsubasa!

09:39.510 --> 09:41.510
Tsubasa did it!

09:41.510 --> 09:43.510
jeez we got it already

09:41.510 --> 09:44.400
<i>A brilliant shot marking the ace's revival!</i>

09:44.400 --> 09:47.140
<i>His Golden Duo with Misaki is revived as well!</i>

09:47.140 --> 09:48.720
Tsubasa!

09:47.500 --> 09:48.720
<i>The score is 3-2.</i>

09:48.720 --> 09:53.150
<i>We're ten minutes into the second half, with Nankatsu narrowing the lead to one goal.</i>

09:53.150 --> 09:54.530
Tsubasa...

09:54.530 --> 09:56.890
<i>You did it, Tsubasa.</i>

09:56.890 --> 10:00.780
<i>It may be true that right now, Misugi is better, technique-wise.</i>

10:00.780 --> 10:05.790
<i>But that's only because he's already developed his skills.</i>

10:05.790 --> 10:10.000
<i>Conversely, you will continue to grow into a better player.</i>

10:10.000 --> 10:12.420
<i>You have the potential, you have the willpower,</i>

10:12.420 --> 10:17.580
<i>and most importantly, you are blessed with good friends you can grow up together with.</i>

10:17.580 --> 10:21.820
I feel like it's been a while seeing your happy expression, Roberto.

10:23.410 --> 10:26.340
<i>Even our offside trap is broken now.</i>

10:26.340 --> 10:28.810
<i>You recovered perfectly, Tsubasa.</i>

10:28.810 --> 10:31.560
<i>We have unfinished business.</i>

10:31.560 --> 10:35.760
Dear, the time limit that doctor told us is long past now.

10:35.760 --> 10:38.610
Let's have Jun get benched.

10:38.610 --> 10:41.040
Kojima, get warmed up.

10:41.040 --> 10:42.610
We might need you to go in.

10:42.610 --> 10:44.950
What? O-okay.

10:45.600 --> 10:49.710
Listen. Nankatsu's riding a wave of momentum, right now.

10:49.710 --> 10:53.610
Let's put all of our spirit into quelling those waves.

10:53.610 --> 10:54.340
Yeah!

10:55.590 --> 10:58.590
<i>The match resumes with Musashi's kick-off!</i>

10:58.590 --> 11:01.340
<i>Let's continue our battle, Tsubasa.</i>

11:01.340 --> 11:04.350
<i>I will overcome Nankatsu once more by myself!</i>

11:04.350 --> 11:06.350
sudden heart attack

11:12.680 --> 11:15.480
Doctor, how's Kojiro doing now?

11:15.480 --> 11:17.200
The daily exposure to that heat,

11:17.200 --> 11:21.440
plus his accumulated fatigue, and mental stress on top of it all...

11:21.440 --> 11:23.490
It looks like it's taking its toll all at once.

11:23.490 --> 11:26.160
It seems like overexertion, honestly.

11:26.160 --> 11:30.250
What he needs right now is bed rest and sleep.

11:30.250 --> 11:32.500
Kojiro...

11:33.750 --> 11:35.790
Coach Kira, what's his condition?

11:35.790 --> 11:37.880
Will our captain be able to play tomorrow?

11:38.920 --> 11:40.420
Don't worry!

11:40.420 --> 11:43.430
There is no way Kojiro will back away from this fight.

11:43.430 --> 11:45.050
Seriously?!

11:46.260 --> 11:52.980
For now, the tiger must rest, and begin collecting his strength for tomorrow's final.

12:03.020 --> 12:05.460
<i>It's the National Youth Football Tournament,</i>

12:05.460 --> 12:07.700
<i>semi-finals: Musashi FC vs. Nankatsu SC.</i>

12:07.700 --> 12:09.950
<i>There's very little time left in this match.</i>

12:09.950 --> 12:12.240
<i>It's anybody's game, now.</i>

12:13.460 --> 12:16.080
<i>Both teams struggle against the pouring rain!</i>

12:17.630 --> 12:19.710
Persevere, Nankatsu!

12:19.710 --> 12:21.460
Now's the time to push yourselves!

12:23.300 --> 12:25.040
<i>Has the team's foundation,</i>

12:25.040 --> 12:27.390
<i>Misugi, run out of stamina?</i>

12:27.390 --> 12:29.760
<i>His movements have started to slow down.</i>

12:29.760 --> 12:31.020
Jun!

12:31.020 --> 12:31.930
Captain!

12:34.300 --> 12:37.560
Don't think your control over the field will continue, Misugi!

12:39.010 --> 12:40.830
<i>Nankatsu is tackling fiercely!</i>

12:40.830 --> 12:43.900
<i>But, Misugi refuses to give up the ball!</i>

12:44.740 --> 12:46.860
How can he move like that in this rain?!

12:46.860 --> 12:48.740
He's supposed to be getting tired!

12:49.780 --> 12:53.830
<i>Ah! Tsubasa himself approaches to take the ball!</i>

12:53.830 --> 12:57.290
<i>Misugi, I'll give you my all!</i>

12:58.660 --> 13:00.040
<i>He's got the ball!</i>

13:00.040 --> 13:04.300
<i>This time, it's Tsubasa who cleanly dispossesses Misugi!</i>

13:04.300 --> 13:05.920
That's right, Tsubasa!

13:05.920 --> 13:07.800
Football is not just techniques!

13:07.800 --> 13:12.680
Sometimes, speed and strength just like Hyuga's is needed!

13:12.680 --> 13:14.270
Damn! Stop him!

13:14.270 --> 13:17.140
<i>Musashi pulls back their defensive line!</i>

13:17.140 --> 13:21.650
<i>The field's muddy! They'll catch me at this rate. It's all or nothing!</i>

13:21.650 --> 13:23.440
All right! I'm taking it!

13:25.720 --> 13:26.570
<i>What?!</i>

13:26.570 --> 13:29.960
<i>Tsubasa is using the water to take a long slide!</i>

13:29.960 --> 13:32.580
<i>He's faster than the running Musashi defenders!</i>

13:32.580 --> 13:33.580
What?!

13:33.580 --> 13:36.660
<i>He gets into shooting position as he slides!</i>

13:39.620 --> 13:40.760
<i>And it's in!</i>

13:40.760 --> 13:41.670
<i>It's a tie!</i>

13:41.670 --> 13:46.420
<i>The clever use of the wet field leads Tsubasa to a goal!</i>

13:46.420 --> 13:48.420
We're tied now!

13:48.420 --> 13:50.120
You did it, Tsubasa!

13:50.120 --> 13:52.430
You even made the wet field your friend, too!

13:55.060 --> 13:57.980
<i>What's happening?</i>

13:57.980 --> 14:00.560
<i>Musashi FC's captain Misugi,</i>

14:00.560 --> 14:03.570
<i>is bent over on the field, clutching his chest.</i>

14:03.570 --> 14:04.690
Misugi!

14:04.690 --> 14:06.820
Captain!

14:06.820 --> 14:08.570
Jun!

14:08.570 --> 14:09.570
Dear!

14:11.490 --> 14:13.950
Player change! Kojima!

14:13.950 --> 14:14.730
Yes, sir!

14:14.730 --> 14:19.580
Wait. Please wait, coach.

14:19.580 --> 14:22.710
You promised me.

14:22.710 --> 14:27.090
You promised me I'd play the entire match.

14:27.090 --> 14:28.840
Misugi...

14:28.840 --> 14:32.910
Everybody, I'm sorry I hid this from you.

14:32.910 --> 14:36.060
As you can see, I have a heart disease.

14:37.140 --> 14:40.270
That's why my minutes in matches have been limited.

14:40.270 --> 14:43.100
But this match is different!

14:43.100 --> 14:45.860
Nankatsu is not an opponent we can win against

14:45.860 --> 14:47.280
if I play for mere minutes!

14:47.280 --> 14:49.810
That's why I made this decision!

14:49.810 --> 14:52.660
I don't care if this is my last match!

14:52.660 --> 14:55.560
In exchange, I decided to play the full time,

14:55.560 --> 14:59.130
and to give it my all in my last match!

14:59.130 --> 15:00.410
Captain.

15:00.410 --> 15:03.330
That's why I refuse to be subbed out!

15:03.330 --> 15:07.920
Tsubasa, my battle with you isn't over yet!

15:07.920 --> 15:09.120
Misugi...

15:09.120 --> 15:11.600
That's how you do it, Jun!

15:12.340 --> 15:16.660
Nobody's going to stop you from playing your beloved football today.

15:16.660 --> 15:18.850
Play with all your might, until the end!

15:18.850 --> 15:20.480
Dad...

15:20.480 --> 15:23.600
Kojima, there'll be no switch.

15:23.600 --> 15:26.980
Misugi, I'm leaving this match to you!

15:26.980 --> 15:28.350
Coach!

15:28.350 --> 15:30.160
Let's do this, captain!

15:30.160 --> 15:32.420
We'll follow you until the end!

15:32.420 --> 15:33.610
Guys...!

15:33.610 --> 15:35.700
Misugi has a heart disease!

15:35.700 --> 15:37.380
That guy?!

15:37.380 --> 15:40.060
Everybody, play as if nothing's changed.

15:40.060 --> 15:40.750
Eh?!

15:41.240 --> 15:45.840
We'll answer that fighting spirit with our own!

15:45.840 --> 15:51.340
<i>Tsubasa, you already knew!</i>

15:51.860 --> 15:54.230
<i>Only seven minutes remain here,</i>

15:54.230 --> 15:56.100
<i>in this semi-final match.</i>

15:56.100 --> 15:59.140
<i>Is Misugi's health still a question?</i>

15:59.140 --> 16:02.480
<i>He still holds his chest and has moved back in the midfield.</i>

16:02.480 --> 16:04.070
<i>Captain...</i>

16:04.980 --> 16:08.400
<i>The match restarts with Musashi FC's kick-off.</i>

16:08.400 --> 16:11.070
We are gonna do captain's share, too!

16:11.070 --> 16:11.780
Yeah!

16:11.780 --> 16:13.360
<i>Misugi...</i>

16:15.890 --> 16:17.720
<i>Tsubasa has stolen the ball!</i>

16:17.720 --> 16:19.580
<i>He's closing in on Musashi's side!</i>

16:19.580 --> 16:21.320
All right! Let's turn the tables!

16:21.320 --> 16:21.950
Yeah!

16:21.950 --> 16:25.290
<i>But Misugi stands in Tsubasa's way!</i>

16:27.900 --> 16:30.820
<i>Misugi, if it wasn't for your disease,</i>

16:30.820 --> 16:33.550
<i>you could keep playing the football you love so much.</i>

16:35.550 --> 16:37.250
<i>But I'm not here to lose.</i>

16:37.250 --> 16:38.850
<i>I love football, too.</i>

16:38.850 --> 16:43.310
<i>I won't lose to anyone in my beloved football!</i>

16:43.310 --> 16:46.900
<i>Misugi still can't move!</i>

16:51.600 --> 16:53.070
No, Misugi!

16:53.070 --> 16:56.280
The Young Noble of the Field is covered in mud!

16:56.280 --> 16:57.620
Captain...

16:57.620 --> 16:59.520
<i>Musashi mounts a desperate defense!</i>

16:59.520 --> 17:00.870
Take it, Kisugi!

17:01.280 --> 17:02.240
It's mine!

17:03.540 --> 17:05.250
<i>Kanda deflects the shot!</i>

17:05.250 --> 17:06.190
I'll score!

17:06.190 --> 17:07.920
<i>Taki tries to head the wild ball!</i>

17:07.920 --> 17:09.330
Like hell!

17:09.330 --> 17:11.420
<i>Sanada shuts him down!</i>

17:11.420 --> 17:13.420
<i>Izawa takes a shot!</i>

17:14.130 --> 17:15.880
<i>The keeper pushes it away!</i>

17:15.880 --> 17:18.300
<i>Honma stops the ball.</i>

17:18.300 --> 17:19.880
<i>Musashi is out of trouble!</i>

17:19.880 --> 17:22.720
Come on Honma, pass!

17:22.720 --> 17:24.890
Pass me the ball, Honma!

17:24.890 --> 17:27.770
Captain, I'm counting on you!

17:27.770 --> 17:29.730
<i>Honma passes to Misugi!</i>

17:29.730 --> 17:32.020
<i>Musashi is about to counterattack!</i>

17:32.020 --> 17:32.610
All right!

17:33.460 --> 17:37.200
<i>Misugi starts to dribble ahead!</i>

17:37.200 --> 17:38.450
Everybody fall back!

17:38.450 --> 17:39.960
<i>It hurts.</i>

17:39.960 --> 17:43.520
<i>My chest hurts. My heart feels like it's gonna explode.</i>

17:43.520 --> 17:46.160
<i>Every step I take, every time my foot</i>

17:46.160 --> 17:48.250
<i>steps on the ground, it's a stab to my heart.</i>

17:48.250 --> 17:51.720
<i>But my heart is still beating.</i>

17:51.720 --> 17:53.240
<i>I can still dribble.</i>

17:53.240 --> 17:56.760
<i>I can still jump.
I can still shoot.</i>

17:56.760 --> 18:03.070
<i>Dad, mom, manager, coach, my teammates...</i>

18:03.070 --> 18:05.770
<i>All those who have supported me...</i>

18:06.460 --> 18:08.670
<i>I thank you all.</i>

18:08.670 --> 18:11.880
<i>I, Jun Misugi, as the captain of Musashi FC,</i>

18:11.880 --> 18:14.580
<i>will score this goal for everybody,</i>

18:14.580 --> 18:16.030
<i>even if it kills me!</i>

18:16.030 --> 18:18.280
<i>Misugi is moving fast!</i>

18:18.940 --> 18:20.230
What speed...!

18:20.230 --> 18:23.410
He's the one dribbling, how is he so much faster?!

18:23.410 --> 18:25.200
<i>We won't catch him like this!</i>

18:25.200 --> 18:26.790
<i>This is the only thing I can do.</i>

18:26.790 --> 18:30.120
<i>Misaki starts a sliding tackle from afar!</i>

18:30.120 --> 18:32.130
<i>He uses the wet field to gain speed!</i>

18:32.130 --> 18:33.130
Nice, Misaki!

18:33.130 --> 18:34.380
Captain, look out!

18:34.380 --> 18:37.260
<i>Jump! Jump and dodge it!</i>

18:39.130 --> 18:40.970
<i>He dodges it with a jump!</i>

18:40.970 --> 18:45.060
<i>How can he jump this high with the pitch as slippery as it is...?!</i>

18:45.060 --> 18:47.850
<i>But the centre-back Takasugi is giving chase!</i>

18:47.850 --> 18:49.600
I'm going to stop you, Misugi!

18:49.600 --> 18:52.100
Look out! His heart is on that side!

18:53.400 --> 18:54.150
Jun!

18:54.980 --> 18:57.150
<i>He loses his balance!</i>

18:57.150 --> 18:58.400
Misugi!

18:59.980 --> 19:04.200
<i>Misugi uses his leg as he falls and manages to keep the ball!</i>

19:05.280 --> 19:07.150
<i>Takasugi tumbles!</i>

19:07.150 --> 19:09.830
<i>This tenacity is unlike anything we've seen yet!</i>

19:09.830 --> 19:12.210
<i>Can Misugi shoot?</i>

19:12.210 --> 19:15.370
<i>Tsubasa, Nankatsu's captain, is coming for the ball!</i>

19:16.420 --> 19:17.670
Captain!

19:17.670 --> 19:19.760
<i>You've fought well, Misugi!</i>

19:20.280 --> 19:21.930
<i>But I'm not backing down now.</i>

19:22.410 --> 19:26.020
<i>Tsubasa, I can't give you this ball.</i>

19:26.020 --> 19:28.180
<i>This is my ball.</i>

19:28.180 --> 19:30.140
<i>This is the ball I'll shoot!</i>

19:30.940 --> 19:32.990
<i>Tsubasa clears the ball!</i>

19:32.990 --> 19:35.150
<i>Misugi desperately blocks!</i>

19:36.610 --> 19:40.990
<i>The ball is rising above them!</i>

19:44.630 --> 19:45.950
I can't see...

19:45.950 --> 19:47.950
<i>Clear! I have to clear the ball!</i>

19:50.400 --> 19:53.290
The ball. My ball.

19:53.290 --> 19:56.090
The ball! Where's the ball?

19:56.090 --> 19:59.380
Where's the ball?

19:59.380 --> 20:03.720
Captain! The ball is right in front you, slightly to the right!

20:04.530 --> 20:06.970
<i>I can see it... I can see it!</i>

20:06.970 --> 20:08.560
<i>My ball...</i>

20:10.930 --> 20:12.210
<i>is right here!</i>

20:12.210 --> 20:14.440
<i>Misugi's shot is a split second faster!</i>

20:15.190 --> 20:17.380
<i>Morisaki can't get it!</i>

20:17.380 --> 20:21.190
<i>It's a goal! Misugi scores a goal through sheer tenacity!</i>

20:24.590 --> 20:26.030
<i>4-3! Musashi scores a goal,</i>

20:26.030 --> 20:29.540
<i>with less than 2 minutes remaining!</i>

20:30.400 --> 20:32.410
It's in...

20:32.410 --> 20:34.040
You did it, Misugi!

20:34.040 --> 20:36.420
What a tenacious goal!

20:36.420 --> 20:38.540
That's our captain for you!

20:51.840 --> 20:53.350
Misugi...

21:03.750 --> 21:05.170
It's beating.

21:08.830 --> 21:12.750
My heart's still beating!

21:13.950 --> 21:15.420
I'm all right!

21:15.420 --> 21:18.210
My heart hasn't broken yet!

21:18.210 --> 21:19.210
Misugi!

21:19.210 --> 21:20.210
Captain!

21:20.210 --> 21:21.210
Jun!

21:21.210 --> 21:23.840
Misugi, are you all right?

21:23.840 --> 21:26.970
We have a one-goal lead on you, Tsubasa.

21:28.220 --> 21:33.350
We'll defend it, and we'll be the ones going to the final!

21:36.600 --> 21:37.770
Misugi...

21:39.620 --> 21:41.480
<i>Less than 2 minutes remain.</i>

21:41.480 --> 21:45.740
<i>Following Misugi's hearty play,</i>

21:45.740 --> 21:47.540
<i>Musashi FC are once again in the lead, 4-3!</i>

21:47.540 --> 21:49.260
What's with you all?

21:49.260 --> 21:51.370
The match isn't over yet!

21:51.370 --> 21:52.820
It's just one goal!

21:52.820 --> 21:54.330
You can still turn this around!

21:54.330 --> 21:56.740
That's right! We'll win, Nankatsu!

21:54.330 --> 21:56.740
Do your best!

21:56.740 --> 21:59.440
You never know until the final whistle's blown!

21:59.440 --> 22:01.250
All right, let's keep fighting!

22:01.250 --> 22:03.880
Yeah! The match isn't over yet!

22:03.880 --> 22:06.260
Let's give everything we've got until the end!

22:06.750 --> 22:08.630
<i>This goal was huge.</i>

22:09.130 --> 22:12.140
<i>But you feel even bigger now, Misugi.</i>

22:12.140 --> 22:16.060
<i>But you only need 10 seconds to score a goal in football!</i>

22:16.060 --> 22:18.090
<i>I will surely catch up to you!</i>

22:38.750 --> 22:44.630
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.750 --> 22:44.630
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.630 --> 22:50.630
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.630 --> 22:50.630
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.630 --> 22:56.640
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.630 --> 22:56.640
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.640 --> 23:02.100
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.640 --> 23:02.100
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.060 --> 23:08.240
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.060 --> 23:08.240
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.150 --> 23:14.950
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.150 --> 23:14.950
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:14.950 --> 23:21.000
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.000 --> 23:26.000
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.000 --> 23:26.000
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:27.300 --> 23:33.180
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:27.300 --> 23:33.180
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.180 --> 23:39.060
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.060 --> 23:45.940
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.060 --> 23:45.940
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:50.030 --> 24:00.640
COMING UP, EPISODE 22:
THE DESTINED ADDITIONAL TIME
